Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:54.01,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you, my name is Kaga Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.01,0:22:56.24,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Today I'm going to a new nursery school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:58.90,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,But everybody already went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:01.67,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't he going to pick me up soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,{now she plays shiritori, that is a game where you have to say a new word starting with the last sound of the last word, don't know how to translate it properly}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.67,0:23:02.92,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:04.85,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Chikyuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:07.74,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Uchuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:04.85,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:07.74,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Space...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:10.25,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,U... U...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:11.90,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Usukuchi Shouyu. {Light flavored Soy Sauce}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:11.90,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Light flavored Soy Sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.90,0:23:13.69,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Yu... Yu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.27,0:23:16.84,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Yubikiri genman
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.27,0:23:16.84,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "Pinky Swear."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:19.00,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, it ended in an "n"! {In shiritori, when someone says a word ended in 'n', this person loses the game}
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.88,0:02:39.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.14,0:02:42.56,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.26,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.88,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:47.88,0:02:51.13,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.13,0:02:54.53,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.53,0:03:00.08,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.58,0:03:06.34,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.45,0:03:10.89,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.59,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.03,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.03,0:03:20.16,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.55,0:03:23.92,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.14,0:03:30.45,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.81,0:03:37.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:03:37.14,0:03:40.58,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.02,0:03:48.29,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.88,0:02:39.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.14,0:02:42.56,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.26,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.88,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:47.88,0:02:51.13,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.13,0:02:54.53,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.53,0:03:00.08,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.58,0:03:06.34,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.45,0:03:10.68,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.48,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.03,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.03,0:03:20.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.55,0:03:23.92,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.14,0:03:30.45,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.81,0:03:37.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:37.14,0:03:40.58,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.02,0:03:48.29,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:30.95,0:20:35.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 4,0:20:36.11,0:20:38.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:41.37,0:20:45.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 4,0:20:45.93,0:20:50.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.66,0:20:55.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 4,0:20:56.90,0:21:00.96,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 4,0:21:00.96,0:21:05.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.63,0:21:10.91,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.27,0:21:15.48,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.12,0:21:21.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.79,0:21:25.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:26.61,0:21:31.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.26,0:21:36.43,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.95,0:21:45.49,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 4,0:20:30.95,0:20:35.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:36.11,0:20:38.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:41.37,0:20:45.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 4,0:20:45.93,0:20:50.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.66,0:20:55.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 4,0:20:56.90,0:21:00.96,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:00.96,0:21:05.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.63,0:21:10.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.27,0:21:15.48,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.12,0:21:21.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.79,0:21:25.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:26.61,0:21:31.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.26,0:21:36.43,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.95,0:21:45.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? That's fine...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.93,0:00:42.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was just about to get up...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.43,0:00:46.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see. Got it.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.52,0:00:50.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you not to worry about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll negotiate with the other side next week. Okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.53,0:00:57.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My grandfather died last night.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That dream I had...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:10.17,0:01:12.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was that Grandpa and...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:12.84,0:01:14.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.51,0:01:24.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seems he'd lost touch with all of the relatives...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.21,0:01:51.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I come back after all this time and it's for a funeral...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.28,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Daikichi, you got here fast.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.28,0:04:27.62,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Put your luggage in Grandpa's bedroom, okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.03,0:04:31.58,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There was some little girl in the garden.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was that Haruko's girl? I can't remember.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.79,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't Reina-chan...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.50,0:04:39.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whose kid is she?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.46,0:04:45.22,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh! This kitchen is difficult to use.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.22,0:04:54.35,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what I should do from now on.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He was 79 and had a peaceful death, didn't he?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:58.11,0:05:01.19,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, that girl is Grandpa's illegitimate child...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:01.69,0:05:02.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.07,0:05:05.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's {\i1}child{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.74,0:05:08.91,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa didn't say a thing about it...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.95,0:05:12.29,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,And his lover took off, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.29,0:05:15.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,His lover?! He was 79!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.62,0:05:19.08,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's so embarrassing, not to mention shameful...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then she's...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,like your little sister...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.84,0:05:25.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and my {\i1}aunt{\i0}...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:25.63,0:05:28.09,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously! How can you joke around about this?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.64,0:05:32.10,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You're 30 years old! Old enough not to make such thoughtless remarks!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.21,0:06:00.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You died at peace, huh, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.82,Main Dialog,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,About how much should I put in?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.31,0:06:26.61,Main Dialog,Note,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Note: It's traditional to give money as a condolence gift, known as {\i1}koden{\i0}.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:23.82,0:06:27.40,Main Dialog,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,As much as you like. It can be any amount.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.40,0:06:30.99,Main Dialog,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but there's a certain standard amount, isn't there?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.99,0:06:33.20,Main Dialog,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, any amount is fine...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.20,0:06:35.91,Main Dialog,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Although these days, it's very common for sutras to be recited
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.91,0:06:39.46,Main Dialog,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,and a posthumous Buddhist name to be given...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.17,0:06:45.13,Main Dialog,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,She said 400,000 to 500,000 yen.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.55,0:06:47.84,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a large sum of money.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.88,0:06:53.43,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.93,0:06:55.18,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been busy?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:55.81,0:06:57.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, busy enough...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.39,0:07:02.10,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You always say you're busy! Too busy to visit your own mother...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.10,0:07:04.65,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't even come home for New Year's.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.32,0:07:10.36,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop running! Reina!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.37,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it! Reina!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.70,0:07:20.41,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Dai-chan! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.54,0:07:20.16,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.41,0:07:21.67,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.00,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.42,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Now be a good girl and don't run around!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.26,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No way! I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.21,0:07:30.30,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.93,0:07:37.97,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,You look a lot like your grandfather did when he was younger.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.98,0:07:47.36,Main Dialog,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you hear?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.36,0:07:49.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, from my mom earlier.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.03,0:07:51.49,Main Dialog,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it's true.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.49,0:07:55.82,Main Dialog,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure my elder brother was lonely living alone, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.82,0:07:58.12,Main Dialog,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, there's a Maternal and Child Health Handbook.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:58.12,0:07:59.95,Main Dialog,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,It says her name is "Rin."
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.95,0:08:03.62,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nevertheless, we're talking about a 79-year-old man...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, setting aside that it was Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.84,0:08:10.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,somehow I actually feel like he did an admirable job.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.67,0:08:14.55,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, would you bring the cushions out of the closet for me?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.55,0:08:15.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.82,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's swap!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.23,0:09:13.07,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.03,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it like it is!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.08,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.54,0:09:27.25,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look! Look!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.25,0:09:29.54,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, don't run!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.92,Main Dialog,Sayuri,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, how clever!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.26,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Is it pretty?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.26,0:09:37.13,Main Dialog,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,It certainly is! You're very good at cat's cradle, Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.51,0:09:42.26,Main Dialog,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,Next, try to make a four-square ladder!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.18,0:09:44.93,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.93,0:09:47.90,Main Dialog,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my, Reina-chan... Here, let me show you.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.90,0:09:48.85,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-uh!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.61,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Poop bomb!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.61,0:09:52.11,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it this instant, Reina!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.45,0:10:42.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle, Uncle...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:43.53,0:10:45.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Please, sleep before I do.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:45.37,0:10:47.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take my turn watching the incense.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.54,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.88,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't sleep in here!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.71,0:10:57.88,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get some rest over there.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.05,Main Dialog,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,What about the incense?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.05,0:11:02.22,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi says he'll watch over it.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.68,0:11:04.76,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oof...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.76,0:11:08.18,Main Dialog,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of my big brother.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.36,0:11:17.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You get some sleep over there, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:19.65,0:11:21.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.99,0:11:24.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What an unsightly face.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.85,0:11:50.98,Main Dialog,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.98,0:11:53.48,Main Dialog,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Please say your final farewells.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.73,0:12:01.15,Main Dialog,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.03,Main Dialog,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Big brother...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.03,0:12:02.78,Main Dialog,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.78,0:12:04.99,Main Dialog,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.95,0:12:10.20,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina! Come along!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.54,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.67,0:12:16.04,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to say goodbye to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.42,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.09,0:12:26.14,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,A field of flowers!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.30,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.39,0:12:33.06,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No! I'm making a field of flowers!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.06,0:12:35.73,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna make it!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.53,0:12:45.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You, too, come over here and say goodbye.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Place these on Grandpa.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.65,0:13:20.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rindou...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.17,0:13:41.96,Main Dialog,Note,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs33\an8}[ Note: Rindou means Bellflower ]
Dialogue: 4,0:13:39.84,0:13:41.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa loved that flower...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.11,0:14:05.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That flower makes Grandpa the happiest.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.32,0:14:11.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He's not going to wake up again?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.41,0:14:21.13,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No. He's not going to wake up.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.60,0:14:36.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You really are Grandpa's child, aren't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.10,0:15:58.93,Main Dialog,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Where did this "Yoshii Masako" go?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.64,0:16:02.69,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think any good would come of finding the person
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.69,0:16:05.94,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,who abandoned her child and ran away.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.94,0:16:08.61,Main Dialog,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,How utterly irresponsible!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:09.03,0:16:12.57,Main Dialog,Yoshiharu,0000,0000,0000,,My big brother also was stubborn about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:30.34,0:16:31.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.80,0:16:34.89,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That girl can't talk!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.22,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's annoying!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:36.22,0:16:38.26,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,And she still has all of her baby teeth!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She can talk!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And she's not annoying!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.31,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,She can not talk!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.31,0:16:44.48,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, you know...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:44.48,0:16:45.69,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, you know...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:45.69,0:16:47.48,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,is {\i1}bored{\i0}!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:48.77,0:16:52.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here! You can have all these if you go away!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.65,0:16:55.41,Main Dialog,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,You're like a candy shop owner!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.99,0:16:57.82,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.45,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Setting aside the matter of future plans,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.45,0:17:04.41,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,who's going to take care of that child right now?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:04.41,0:17:05.92,Main Dialog,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be impossible for us,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:05.92,0:17:07.50,Main Dialog,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,since we're running the shop...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:07.50,0:17:11.21,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,If she were a little more proper...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.21,0:17:14.01,Main Dialog,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,And she seems to be suffering from delayed speech, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:15.38,0:17:19.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're at home. Why don't you take her in for a while?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:20.39,0:17:23.02,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You know that'd be impossible!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.52,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have that much free time on my hands!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:26.02,0:17:29.98,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand how hard it is to raise a child?!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:29.98,0:17:34.40,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't I made enough sacrifices over the years?!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.40,0:17:37.78,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,If she were taken in half-heartedly, it'd only end up being bad for her.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.49,0:17:43.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't this meeting supposed to be about who {\i1}would{\i0} care for Rin?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.20,0:17:48.17,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like you have any intention of doing anything, do you, big brother?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.17,0:17:50.29,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at it a bit more realistically.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:50.29,0:17:56.22,Main Dialog,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,In the first place, I'm not even certain that she truly is Grandpa's child.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.93,0:18:00.76,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,See? You haven't thought it through, so you can't even reply.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:34.59,0:18:39.84,Main Dialog,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,For now, I say we try to place her in a facility as quickly as possible...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:47.14,0:18:48.18,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:59.90,0:19:00.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.25,0:19:16.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna come to my place?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.80,0:19:19.26,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.26,0:19:20.26,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Brother?!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.26,0:20:10.23,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Old man, I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.89,0:20:12.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,O-Old man...?!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.60,0:20:15.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me "old man"!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.86,0:20:21.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Out of the two of us, {\i1}you're{\i0} my aunt!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.12,0:21:59.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.01,Main Dialog,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,More?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.01,0:22:07.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:07.18,0:22:09.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All we have left is rice.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:09.55,0:22:11.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make a rice ball...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:11.89,0:22:14.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything to put in the rice ball.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:14.93,0:22:16.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Salt!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:16.18,0:22:17.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Salt?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.94,0:22:23.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! That's still hot!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.48,0:22:24.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.94,0:22:29.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it'll have a tender taste.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:29.82,0:22:31.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here, old man.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:32.53,0:22:35.08,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I mean... Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.75,0:22:37.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi is strange too...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.75,0:22:44.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:41.52,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fax0.18\fay-0.05\pos(774,427)}Kawachi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.74,0:23:19.99,Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(642,275)}Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.74,0:23:19.99,Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\an8\pos(642,440)}Pinky Swear
